<section class="gg-ad-landing gg-awareness-page">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-ad-hero">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Goal Grower</span>

      <h1>Turn your goals into something you can grow.</h1>

      <p>
        Goal Grower is a habit and goal app where every goal becomes a plant in your digital garden.
        Stay consistent, water your progress, and watch your goals grow.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn">Join Beta Testing</a>
        <a href="/pages/about" class="gg-btn-soft">Learn More</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-awareness-grid">
      <div class="gg-awareness-card">
        <span>🌱</span>
        <h2>Goals become plants</h2>
        <p>Each goal you create grows as you keep showing up.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-awareness-card">
        <span>💧</span>
        <h2>Progress feels visual</h2>
        <p>Water your plants by completing habits and goal steps.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-awareness-card">
        <span>🤝</span>
        <h2>Grow together</h2>
        <p>Shared gardens help friends stay accountable together.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-ad-section">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Why it exists</span>
      <h2>Most goal apps feel like chores. Goal Grower makes progress feel alive.</h2>
      <p>
        Instead of staring at a checklist, you build a garden that reflects your effort.
        It is simple, visual, and made for people who want goals to feel less overwhelming.
      </p>

      <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn">Become a Beta Tester</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

